            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ĩndĩ ethĩwa ũla ũthũkũmi wa kĩkw’ũ, waandĩkĩtwe ũvanĩtwe masengeanĩ ma mavia, wookie na ũtheu mũtisu, ũndũ ana ma Isilaeli matyaatonya kũketeea ũthyũ wa Mose kwondũ wa ũtheu mũtisu waw’o; na nĩ ũtheu mũtisu ũla wavĩtĩte: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
